OL,3,AThree charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo adults and a teenager have been
OL,7,Fcharged with attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fshotgun was fired in a town centre.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Market Place in
OL,11,FBraintree, Essex, at about 22:10 BST on
OL,12,FMonday following what officers
OL,13,Fdescribed as a "targeted attack".
OL,15,FTwo teenagers sustained serious
OL,16,Finjuries to their face and upper body,
OL,17,Fwhile a third person was also injured.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
